id, using a 3x3 array.</p>
<p>As we iterate through each cell in the grid, we check if a previously en=
countered number already exists in the current row, column, or subgrid, by =
querying the appropriate hash sets:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If the number is in any of these hash sets, return false.</p>
